				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Persistent rumours are that <strong>Madonna</strong> was about to be on board to direct a new <strong>movie</strong> in 2015. But her manager, <strong>Guy Oseary</strong>, guarantees that <strong>Madonna</strong> will not direct any movie next year.</p>
