				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Finally! <strong>Desperately Seeking Susan to be released on Blu-ray </strong>on October 14th, 2014 by U.S. distributor Kino Lorber. <strong>Desperately Seeking Susan</strong> is one of the first acclaimed classics to be released by the brand new Kino Lorber Studio Classics label.</p>
<p><strong>Desperately Seeking Susan</strong> is starring <strong>Madonna</strong>, Rosanna Arquette, Aidan Quinn, Mark Blum, and John Turturro and is directed by Susan Seidelman.</p>
<p>The Blu-ray will have these special features:</p>
<i class="pixcode  pixcode--icon  icon-e-heart-empty    medium  "></i> Audio Commentary by the Producers<br />
<i class="pixcode  pixcode--icon  icon-e-heart-empty    medium  "></i> Original and Alternate Endings<br />
<i class="pixcode  pixcode--icon  icon-e-heart-empty    medium  "></i> Original Theatrical Trailer<br />
