				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The soundtrack of the musical <strong>Walking on Sunshine</strong> &#8211; out next Friday &#8211; consists entirely of ’80s pop hits, including a playful Disney Channel-like cover of <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s <strong>Holiday</strong>. The song is part of a fully choreographed flash mob scene in the airport to greet Taylor’s arrival in Puglia, Italy.</p>
<p>Other tracks features in the soundtrack of Walking on Sunshine are Cyndi Lauper&#8217;s Girls Just Wanna Have Fun, Duran Duran&#8217;s Wild Boys, George Michael&#8217;s Faith, etc.<a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/madonna-holiday-on-walking-on-sunshine-ost-back.jpg"><img class="alignnone size-large wp-image-957" src="http://drownedmadonna.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/madonna-holiday-on-walking-on-sunshine-ost-back-1024x879.jpg" alt="madonna holiday on walking on sunshine ost back" width="960" height="824" /></a></p>
