<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/alan-parker-madonna-evita-compromise/20140619">Alan Parker about Madonna on Evita: &#8220;She was a compromise&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
